<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy - Shunyata</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-10 px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mb-4">At Shunyata Eco Resort, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you interact with our website and services.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">We may collect personal details such as name, email, phone number, and payment information when you book or use our services.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4">
      <li>To process bookings and payments</li>
      <li>To send confirmations, offers, and updates</li>
      <li>To improve customer experience</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">3. Data Protection</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">We implement strict security measures to protect your personal data. However, no online transmission is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee 100% safety.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">We may share limited data with trusted partners like payment gateways (e.g., Razorpay) only to complete your transactions securely.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">5. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <span class="text-blue-600">support@shunyata.com</span>.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>